# renal_tumour_project
end-to-end ML health project


## Workflows
1. Update config.yaml
2. Update secrets.yaml [optional]
3. Update params.yaml
4. Update the entity
5. Update the configuration manager in src config
6. Update the components
7. Update the pipeline
8. Update main.py
9. Update the dvc.yaml
10. Create and update app.y

# How to run this project

### STEPS:

Clone the repository

'''bash
https://github.com/MicroPyscho/renal_tumour_project
'''

### STEP 01 - Create a Conda environment after opening the repository

'''bash
conda create -n cnncls python==3.13.3 -y
'''

'''bash
conda activate cnncls
'''

### STEP 02- install the requirements
'''bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
'''

### cmd
- mlflow ui

...

### dagshub
[dagshub](https://dagshub.com/)

pip install dagshub

import dagshub
import mlflow

dagshub.init(repo_owner='MicroPyscho', repo_name='renal_tumour_project', mlflow=True)

with mlflow.start_run():
  mlflow.log_param('parameter name', 'value')
  mlflow.log_metric('metric name', 1)
